    "Using Kūki on more than one device? **iCloud Sync** in Settings shares one history." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding, Plan screen: plan line. iCloud Sync is the name of a setting, use the same name as in Settings. The text between ** and ** is set in a heavier weight; keep the two ** markers around the matching words.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تستخدم Kūki على أكثر من جهاز؟ **مزامنة iCloud** في الإعدادات تشارك سجلًا واحدًا."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
